Flags

| Bit | Name | Description             |
| --- | ---- | ----------------------- |
| 0   | Z    | Zero Flag               |
| 1   | C    | Carry Flag              |
| 2   | O    | Overflow Flag           |
| 3   | E    | Equal Flag              |
| 4   | L    | Less Than Flag          |
| 5   | G    | Greater Than Flag       |
| 6   | CTX  | Context Switch Flag     |
| 7   | I    | Interrupt Disable Flag  |